  {
   "id": "bilkins-folly-152909@major-2023-11-11",
   "gameId": "bilkins-folly-152909",
   "displayName": "A nicely-sized update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-11-11T02:32:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A lot of smaller fixes in this update. A big thanks to everyone across the Steam forum and Discord who helped report these. Without that info, none of these patches would exist.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There's also a couple of retroactive Steam achievements that will be unlocked if you completed certain tasks but didn't meet all requirements - previously, giving Gail all the fish without having a high or low relationship with her would not trigger the achievement. so if you launch the game and one of these achievements suddenly unlocks, that's why.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Can no longer fast travel on local map when holding ruler, eraser or pins",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Crabb Island - map tools adjustment, pins were off by a few pixels",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Tot4C map wasn't always unlocking in the journal treasure tab - Retroactively fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievement 'marital bliss' now unlocks no matter what when you give Gail all the fish.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Achievement 'marital bliss' will retroactively unlock for players who already gave her the fish but did not meet the original requirements to unlocking that achievement.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "'Factors of' changed to 'multiples of'",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed an invisible fish from the ship's hold.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed typo in dialogue text word: 'pitiful'",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remy's Lott - map pins were not visible in one specific area.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bat dungeon - moved a rogue bat off-screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Accessiblity - Shattered Peak bell statues - added a visual indicator to show tone of each bell",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed ability to move sheep with the mouse during Cecil's herding puzzle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Crabb Island journal map, moved a statue icon to be closer to it's in-game location",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Swamp dungeon - fixed bug if the door code was entered a second time",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Main menu - left a note detailing how to toggle fullscreen mode (\"F11\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Detective Bumsted will now acknowledge (in her own way) that you've solved the case",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed controller issue where picking up the ruler would create an additional line if button was held",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed journal entry not being added when collecting Cecil's map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed dialogue line at start of Act 3 to correctly acknowledge which parts of the key had been collected so far",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed fishmaster's icon on the local map once entering Act 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed wind and water checkboxes not being unchecked at startup on main menu when they have been disabled",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Forest grove on Crabb Island not fading out if wind effect was disabled",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue where La Moina's key wasn't being unlocked in journal treasure page if pieces were collected in a certain order, which also prevented the keysmith achievement from unlocking which will be fixed retroactively",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed mining on Phelmy Island causing softlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Gail's diary appearing when parked at certain mysterious islands...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Local map, adjusted player's icon so that it's a few pixels more accurate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Can now drop bombs on Phelmy Island... if you really want to.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
